{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112075748598-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112150938\"/><p>元朗區聯同相關部門人員昨日（11日）於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。</p><p>行動中，人員共拘捕21名內地女子，年齡介乎18至73歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕女子現正被扣留調查。據了解，被捕女子年齡最大73歲，在案中角色亦涉及賣淫。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:44:00.093452+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:57:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T11:43:18.137855+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T07:37:18.322529+00:00","content_hash":"e3eeac1313b26bfefb5b7b2f83761979082f6d5f6542e7bb49238ce66793cbd9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:44:00.093452+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}